  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right) \\mathrm{m}=\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}1 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right)$ ....(i)\r\n$\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}3 & 4 & 5\\end{array}\\right) \\mathrm{m}=\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right)$\r\n$\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}6 & 8 & 10\\end{array}\\right) \\mathrm{m}=\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 2 & 0\\end{array}\\right)$ ...(ii)\r\n(ii) $-$ (i)\r\n$\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}6 & 8 & 10\\end{array}\\right) \\mathrm{m}-\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right) \\mathrm{m}$ = $\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}0 & 2 & 0\\end{array}\\right)-\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}1 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right)$\r\n$\\Rightarrow$ $\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}6 & 7 & 8\\end{array}\\right) \\mathrm{m}=\\left(\\begin{array}{lll}-1 & 2 & 0\\end{array}\\right)$",
